{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログを開いてくださりありがとうございます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46 四期生の勝又春です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "8/2  京都のリアミ、ありがとうございました！！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobAwNcQZ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回は、過去2回の浴衣と雰囲気を変えたくて、黒い浴衣を着てみました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "髪の毛は、最近ハマっているハーフアップカチモリにして、大人っぽい感じを目指したんだけど"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なれてたかなー？💭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "後半はね、やっぱ可愛い感じにも憧れて、\nラプンツェルみたいな髪型にしていただいた🙄"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobV498wb.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お花もありがとうございます！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "撮った時の都合でしっかり写りきれてないお花もあってごめんね、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だけど全て1つ1つじっくり見て、メッセージも読ませてもらって、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "幸せだああってまさに写真と同じ表情になってました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ほんとにありがとう☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "___"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "前日8/1は\n「OSAKA GIGANTIC MUSIC FESTIVAL 2026」\nに出演させていただけたので、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2日連続で会いに来てくださる方も沢山いらっしゃいました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「この曲こうだったね〜」とか、\n「あの暑さはアイス食べちゃうよねー」とか、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "昨日の出来事を次の日にすぐ2人でお話しできたから、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この夏も毎日一緒に過ごせてるんだなあと"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "改めて実感し、もう十分というほど外は暑いのに心までぽかぽかとあたたかくなりました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もちろん、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ライブ、ミーグリなど会える機会に来てくださることだけが、一緒に過ごせてると感じるわけではなく！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こうしてブログを読んでくださったり、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "日常の中でふと思い出してくださったり、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "レターで近況報告をしてくれたり、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "その1つ1つが、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あなたと一緒に日々を過ごせてるなと感じるきっかけになっています！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それが一方的にならないように、\n私も、あなたに繋がってると思ってもらえるようになれたらな...💭💪"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "1年の中で、直接会える日数と会えない日数は、\nそれは後者の方が多くなってしまうけど、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だからこそ不安なこととか大変なこともきっとあるだろう毎日の"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "力だとか、息抜きに"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "少しでもなれたら嬉しいです☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobKv6CDR.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobbXZQQz.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつもほんとにありがとう！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また明日🥳"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "勝又 春　#46"}], "source": "official"}